<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20169" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλύζω</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔβλῠσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1446
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				1.242
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.352
			</span></i>, etc.; poet. opt. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλύσσειε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.58
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>): aor.
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐβλύσθη</span> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				5.16
			</span></i>:—<i>bubble, gush forth</i>, of liquids,
			A.R.l.c., Orac. in <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				5.7.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ πηγῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					3.45
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. Αυαίῳ</span>
			<i>with</i> wine, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.58
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>): c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέθυ β.</span>
			<i>spout</i> wine: metaph. of Anacreon, ib. <i><span class="en">
				7.27
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					599
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				17.125
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyd.
					<u>Mag.</u>
					3.45
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσχρὰ καθ᾽ ἡμετέρης ἔβλυσε παρθενίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.352
				</span></i>
			.</div>
